      "content": "that's a good start but it's a bit too polite for a competitive round. i don't need a summary of the pros and cons, i need the actual ammunition. if they're going to win, they can't just \"emphasize\" tax reform, they need to make the UBI position look totally unworkable and economically illiterate. can you give me some much more aggressive, hard-hitting arguments that specifically target the flaws in the UBI logic? like, give me the stuff that actually makes the other side lose their footing. me help them win  thx oh and make",
